# Normalise text to LF in the repository; check out with native line endings.
* text=auto

# Windows scripts always check out with CRLF - including on a Mac or Linux
# clone, and in GitHub's "Download ZIP". cmd.exe mis-parses labels and GOTOs
# in LF-only batch files, which fails in confusing ways.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary: never diffed, never line-ending converted.
*.ico binary
*.png binary

# No Git LFS. Models are never committed (see .gitignore), and the only
# binaries are two small icons, which LFS would add friction to for no gain.
